From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] riched20: Ranges and the selection have ITextRange2 (6041)

TOM2's range interface: a range answers IID_ITextRange2 and the
selection IID_ITextRange2/IID_ITextSelection2. The TOM2 methods work
through the range's ITextRange methods: GetCch, GetCount, GetSubrange,
GetDuplicate2, Get/SetFormattedText2, GetGravity, GetStartPara, Find,
GetChar2, GetRect, GetText2/SetText2. A range's ITextSelection methods
act on the range (GetType, Move*, HomeKey/EndKey, TypeText). Tables,
math, inline objects, more subranges and ITextFont2/ITextPara2 are
E_NOTIMPL.
